38956>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38956>>>                Case Break
38957>>>
38957>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38957>>>
38957>>>        Case End
38957>>>
38957>>>        Send SetActionButtons
